{"id":"zeichen","lemma":"Zeichen","pos":"noun","rank":887,"glosses":["sign, token (object representing something)","signal (gesture, command or other indication to announce or alert)","sign, indication (fact that reveals an underlying state)"],"ipa":"/ˈt͡saɪ̯çən/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/27/De-Zeichen.ogg/De-Zeichen.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Zeichens","plural":"Zeichen"},"examples":[{"text":"Das ist kein gutes Zeichen.","en":"That isn't a good sign.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/758445","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"no / not a"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},null]},{"text":"Das muss ein Zeichen sein.","en":"It must be a sign.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/391145","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to have to","l":"müssen"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to be"}]},{"text":"Gib uns ein Zeichen!","en":"Give us a sign.","words":[{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Das ist ein Zeichen der Zeit.","en":"It's a sign of the times.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"time"}]},{"text":"Was bedeutet dieses Zeichen?","en":"What does this mark mean?","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to imply","l":"bedeuten"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null]}]}